{"id": 29, "ts": 1783910562.9164102, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "agent_2", "message": "I agree with Agent\u202f1\u2019s assessment that the missing stress\u2011resilience and technical\u2011under\u2011pressure data for Candidate\u202fA are less concerning than the clear interpersonal deficits we see in Candidates\u202fB and\u202fD, and the lack of any reliability or stress evidence for Candidate\u202fC.\u202fA is documented as 100\u202f% reliable, makes quick correct decisions, stays calm in a crisis, understands complicated technology, and creates a positive crew atmosphere \u2013 all of which together indicate both operational reliability and a baseline of stress resilience. While A does have some communication\u2011style concerns, they do not rise to the level of the \u201cnasty remarks\u201d (B) or \u201chot temper/know\u2011it\u2011all\u201d (D) that could jeopardize cockpit harmony. Given that the other candidates either lack proven reliability (C) or exhibit serious crew\u2011cooperation problems (B,\u202fD), I now provisionally recommend Candidate\u202fA as the best overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
